# local-only: design docs, generator scripts, Blockbench sources
/docs
/tools
/art
# Stonecutter generates these version project directories from settings.gradle.kts, one per branch.
#
# Only their BUILD output is generated, not the directories themselves: a node may also carry real
# source, and does. `<node>/src/main/resources` is where a resource whose SCHEMA changed lives -- the
# 1.21.4 client-item files, its recipes in the new ingredient form, its rift shader configs -- because
# a JSON cannot carry a `//? if` directive and those files cannot be shared. Ignoring the whole
# directory would drop them on the floor, silently, which it did until this was narrowed.
/versions/*/build/
neoforge/versions/*/build/
fabric/versions/*/build/
